---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';import Select from '../components/Select.astro';import {countries} from '../data/countries';
---
<Layout title="Start your registration" noindex><PageHero eyebrow="ONLINE REGISTRATION" title="Your first step starts here." text="Tell us about your plans in four simple steps. You can review your answers before sending. No payment is required to register your interest."/><noscript><div class="container noscript">Please enable JavaScript for the guided form, or call +1 (226) 799-5303 for help registering.</div></noscript><div class="container form-layout"><aside class="form-sidebar"><h2>A little about your journey.</h2><ol class="progress-list" aria-label="Registration progress">{['Your plans','About you','Your background','Review & send'].map((s,i)=><li class={i===0?'active':''} data-progress={i} aria-current={i===0?'step':undefined}><span>{i+1}</span>{s}</li>)}</ol><p class="sidebar-note">Your registration is an initial enquiry with Verto. It does not submit an application to the Government of Canada.<br/><br/><a href="/contact/">Need help? Contact us ↗</a></p></aside><div><div class="form-card" id="registration-card"><div class="progress-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span id="progress-fill" style="width:25%"></span></div><form id="registration" novalidate><div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this field empty</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div>
<section class="form-step" data-step="0"><span class="form-kicker">STEP 01 / YOUR PLANS</span><h2 tabindex="-1">What brings you to Canada?</h2><p>Choose the service you would like to discuss. We’ll tailor the next questions to your plans.</p><fieldset style="border:0;padding:0;margin:0"><legend class="sr-only">Select your service</legend><div class="choice-grid"><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Work permit" required/><Icon name="work" size={31}/><strong>Work in Canada</strong><p>Support with your work permit application and employment plans.</p></label><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Visitor visa" required/><Icon name="globe" size={31}/><strong>Visit Canada</strong><p>Support with your visitor visa and the purpose of your visit.</p></label></div></fieldset><div class="notice">Considering another pathway? <a href="/contact/">Speak to Verto</a> first to confirm the support available.</div></section>
<section class="form-step" data-step="1" hidden><span class="form-kicker">STEP 02 / ABOUT YOU</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Let’s get to know you.</h2><p>All fields are required unless marked optional. Use an email address and phone number where Verto can reach you.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="firstName">First name</label><input name="firstName" id="firstName" autocomplete="given-name" required maxlength="80"/></div><div class="field"><label for="lastName">Last name</label><input name="lastName" id="lastName" autocomplete="family-name" required maxlength="80"/></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email address</label><input type="email" name="email" id="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"/></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone number, including country code</label><input type="tel" name="phone" id="phone" autocomplete="tel" required maxlength="30" minlength="7" placeholder="+1 226 799 5303"/><small>Include the country code, such as +1 or +234.</small></div><Select name="citizenship" label="Country of citizenship" options={countries}/><Select name="residence" label="Country of residence" options={countries} autocomplete="country-name"/><Select name="ageBand" label="Your age range" options={['18–24','25–34','35–44','45–54','55+']}/><Select name="canadaStatus" label="Your current status in Canada" options={['Outside Canada','Visitor','Worker','Student','Permanent resident','Other / unsure']}/></div></section>
<section class="form-step" data-step="2" hidden><span class="form-kicker">STEP 03 / YOUR BACKGROUND</span><h2 tabindex="-1">A little more context.</h2><p>Share a brief overview. We’ll discuss the details with you personally.</p><div id="work-fields" class="form-grid"><Select name="education" label="Highest education completed" options={['Secondary school','College / diploma','Bachelor’s degree','Master’s degree or higher','Other']}/><Select name="experience" label="Your total work experience" options={['Less than 1 year','1–2 years','3–5 years','6+ years']}/><Select name="jobOffer" label="Do you have a Canadian job offer?" options={['Yes','No','In progress']}/></div><div id="visit-fields" class="form-grid" hidden><Select name="purpose" label="Purpose of your visit" options={['Tourism','Visit family or friends','Business visit','Other']}/><div class="field"><label for="travelMonth">Planned travel month</label><input type="month" name="travelMonth" id="travelMonth" required/></div><Select name="duration" label="Planned length of stay" options={['Less than 2 weeks','2–4 weeks','1–3 months','More than 3 months','Not sure yet']}/></div><div class="form-grid"><Select name="previousRefusal" label="Have you had a Canadian immigration refusal?" options={['No','Yes','Prefer to discuss']}/><div class="field full"><label for="notes">Anything you would like us to know? (optional)</label><textarea name="notes" id="notes" rows="4" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="notes-hint"></textarea><small id="notes-hint">Up to 2,000 characters. Do not include passport numbers, medical records or banking information.</small></div></div></section>
<section class="form-step" data-step="3" hidden><span class="form-kicker">STEP 04 / REVIEW & SEND</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Make sure it feels right.</h2><p>Review your details. You can use “Back” to make changes before submitting.</p><dl id="review" class="review-list"></dl><label class="check-field"><input type="checkbox" name="adult" required/><span>I am 18 or older and I am submitting my own enquiry.</span></label><label class="check-field"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/><span>I consent to Verto Immigration Inc. collecting these details to review my enquiry and contact me about it. I have read the <a href="/privacy/" target="_blank">privacy notice</a>.</span></label><label class="check-field"><input type="checkbox" name="terms" required/><span>I accept the <a href="/terms/" target="_blank">website terms</a> and understand this is an intake request, not an application to IRCC or a guarantee of approval. Any paid services require separate agreed terms.</span></label><div id="turnstile" data-sitekey={import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY||''}></div><p class="privacy-note">No marketing subscription. No document upload. No payment required for this registration.</p></section>
<div id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="form-status"></div><div class="form-buttons"><button type="button" id="back" class="button outline" hidden>← Back</button><button type="button" id="next" class="button">Continue →</button><button type="submit" id="submit" class="button" hidden>Send registration →</button></div></form></div><div class="draft-actions" id="draft-actions"><span id="draft-status">Your answers are sent only when you submit.</span><div><button type="button" id="save-draft" class="text-button">Save draft for this session</button> · <button type="button" id="clear-draft" class="text-button">Clear draft</button></div></div><section id="registration-success" class="form-card" hidden aria-live="polite"><div class="success-icon"><Icon name="check"/></div><span class="form-kicker">YOUR FIRST STEP IS COMPLETE</span><h2 tabindex="-1">Registration received.</h2><p>Your details have been saved for Verto to review. Keep your private reference and tracking link below. Verto will contact you using the details you provided.</p><div id="confirmation-details"></div><div class="notice">Keep your tracking link private. This confirms your enquiry with Verto, not an application to IRCC or an immigration decision.</div><a id="track-link" class="button" href="/track/">View your registration →</a><div class="actions"><button id="print-confirmation" type="button" class="text-button">Print this confirmation</button></div></section></div></div><script src="../scripts/register.ts"></script></Layout>
<style>.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}</style>
